### Income
**Qualifying income: $10,875/mo** — using iTrust Special Alt Doc Option 2 method: most recent year 1099 gross $145,000 minus 10% fixed expense factor = $130,500/yr.

Calculation chain:
- 2025 1099s: Insight Global $85K + Kelly Services $42K + direct clients $18K = $145,000 gross — clients/chang/2-income/1099-nec-amazon-2025.pdf, clients/chang/2-income/1099-nec-microsoft-2025.pdf, clients/chang/2-income/1099-nec-others-2025.pdf
- Program expense factor: 10% (not CPA P&L actual expenses, not 25% standard) — products/itrust/Special Alt Doc 04.27.26.pdf (p.8)
- $145,000 × 0.90 = $130,500/yr = $10,875/mo — analyst:income-analyzer
- CPA P&L actual expenses yield $10,125/mo (backup method; superseded by program's 10% factor which is more favorable) — clients/chang/2-income/cpa-profit-loss.pdf
- Income trending up +9.8% YoY (2024: $132K → 2025: $145K) — analyst:income-analyzer
- YTD may adjust income downward if WVOE shows lower earnings — products/itrust/Special Alt Doc 04.27.26.pdf (p.8)

